  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> (do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac disp